I got jealous.

772
00:41:49,707 --> 00:41:52,710
I'll do my best

773
00:41:52,776 --> 00:41:56,580
so that you feel glad to be alive too.

774
00:42:00,918 --> 00:42:02,319
That's so embarrassing.

775
00:42:03,721 --> 00:42:04,788
I'm going.

776
00:42:20,004 --> 00:42:22,573
You did a great job
persuading my wayward daughter.

777
00:42:23,140 --> 00:42:26,277
She seemed troubled,
so it was fairly easy.

778
00:42:33,484 --> 00:42:35,653
NIPPONIA NATIONAL DIET LIBRARY

779
00:42:35,719 --> 00:42:38,489
It's all thanks to your persuasion,
Ms. Utsunomiya

780
00:42:38,556 --> 00:42:42,359
I only told her the truth.

781
00:42:42,426 --> 00:42:46,096
A lone independent
can't get anyone to come.

782
00:42:46,163 --> 00:42:48,933
They lacked literacy.

783
00:42:49,500 --> 00:42:51,168
They'll learn from here.

784
00:42:55,839 --> 00:42:57,374
Stop it. I don't need it.

785
00:42:58,108 --> 00:42:59,810
I may be rotten,
but I'm no slave to money.

786
00:42:59,877 --> 00:43:02,079
Besides, I'm not my party's leader.

787
00:43:03,447 --> 00:43:05,649
More importantly, your promise.

788
00:43:06,817 --> 00:43:07,952
Keep it.

789
00:43:11,288 --> 00:43:15,225
Ms. Utsunomiya has been
working on this for a long time.

790
00:43:15,292 --> 00:43:17,261
I would appreciate your support.

791
00:43:17,328 --> 00:43:18,963
Easily done.

792
00:43:21,899 --> 00:43:23,100
Mr. Ienaga…

793
00:43:24,168 --> 00:43:27,705
asked me to consider
cutting you off from the party.

794
00:43:28,305 --> 00:43:31,075
But we won a Chiba 17 seat anyway.

795
00:43:31,141 --> 00:43:34,211
Two seats now,
with Miyabi joining our party.

796
00:43:34,278 --> 00:43:36,013
It's a big win.

797
00:43:38,449 --> 00:43:40,117
I'm glad we recovered.

798
00:43:42,353 --> 00:43:44,455
It's fun to watch a colorless man

799
00:43:45,589 --> 00:43:47,324
get dyed in our color.

800
00:43:48,292 --> 00:43:49,326
I enjoy it.

801
00:43:52,596 --> 00:43:54,164
I'm counting on you.

802
00:43:55,466 --> 00:43:57,301
You heard that?

803
00:44:05,542 --> 00:44:08,145
Do you know
what a Diet member's salary is?

804
00:44:08,212 --> 00:44:10,814
Tanuki don't know that.
Because they don't have to.

805
00:44:10,881 --> 00:44:14,218
Humans should know, maybe.
Not like I care.

806
00:44:14,284 --> 00:44:16,020
Next time, a party!

807
00:44:16,086 --> 00:44:18,889
A battle over cold, hard cash!

808
00:44:19,723 --> 00:44:22,326
Are you okay, Nipponia?
Hang in there, Nipponia!

809
00:44:22,393 --> 00:44:25,129
It's 250 yen. What is it for?

810
00:44:25,195 --> 00:44:26,964
Tune in next week for the answer!

811
00:44:27,031 --> 00:44:28,432
It's a profound story.

812
00:44:28,499 --> 00:44:29,900
Subtitle translation by: Quang N.N.
